y forms  so let's see how it evolved and took on  the different forms  the first form in this first form  destroyer resembles a tiny trilobite  with a flattened shell and multiple  spiked protrusions  emerging from its shell which vaguely  resembles its later forms  headquests this form is about a  centimeter long  and was first observed consuming fish in  an aquarium micro destroyer keeps on  growing so it started as one millimeter  tall  three meter meters long and weighs 0.5  kilograms  well it was actually growing gradually  but retained the same form until it was  the size of an insect  later in this form it began to look more  like a tiny horseshoe crab  that was red in color and this all  happened when the tiny forms fed on  organic matter  and grew in number and size the second  form  in this second form the chinese insect  destroyers  combine to form a larger version which  was 2 meters in height  and would actually grow into about 18  meters tall in the same form  in this juvenile form destroyer looks  like a giant spider-like crab creature  with a frill on its head  and a secondary mouth inside its mouth  the inner jaw  it gains the ability to fire a  micro-oxygen beam in this form  and this form already spots a horned  crested head similar to that of the  final form  but its mouth is insect-like with  multiple sets of mandibles  there were many of these juvenile  destroyers and quite a number were  killed by using flamethrowers  and was sent to hiding later on the  third form  these juvenile forms which were hiding  would eventually come out together to  form an aggregate form  but before this happened the  self-defense forces deployed mazer tanks  armed with ultra low temperature lasers  and tanks with cadmium shells  they opened fire on the juvenile  destroyers when they resurfaced and  destroyed many of them  but they did eventually manage to  combine together and this destroyer  looks  like a much larger version of the  juvenile but with two  crab claws and two massive spear-like  claws on his back  this aggregate destroyer is 60 meters  tall 40 meters long and weighs  15 000 tons and by this time the  self-defense forces could not match its  power  the fourth form in this form destroyer  finally battled godzilla  well junior godzilla actually right  after combining into its aggregate form  some time later it evolved wings which  gave it the ability of flight  in this flying form destroyer has two  wing-like lobes on its sides  a forked tail and a nasal horn it gains  flight capabilities and retains its  micro-oxygen beam  flying destroyer is 65 meters long with  a wingspan of 80 meters  and weighs 15 000 tons this form battled  with godzilla junior until it was shut  down by an atomic breath  and reconstituted itself back into the  third form or the aggregate form  it then again battled with junior until  it was sent into its presumed  destruction ending the fight temporarily  the fifth form re-emerging from the  burning refinery  its final form is the largest one of all  this form sports bat-like wings  large curved horns on the sides of its  head a humanoid body structure  and a long tail with a pincer at the end  this forms face is more dinosaurian with  a white mouth filled with  sharp teeth and overall resembles a  traditional depiction of a demon  perfect destroyer as it is known as 120  meters tall  and 230 meters long with a wingspan of  210 meters  and weighs 80 000 tons it has  thick arms and legs adorning the white  claws  the knee area of the legs has white  spikes protruding out  the flower like structure on the chest  is red white and on the shoulders  there are large red white spikes finally  there is a long  orange horn that projects from the top  of the head  so now that we have discussed all the  five forms of destroyer  what about the powers that desaroya has  in its perfect form  well it retains its primary weapon the  microoxygen beam  and it can use this to disintegrate any  life-form it 